		"&o&7The Obsidilith has been created after the War of Chaos to prevent anyone from awakening the Netherman, the Architect of Chaos. Being an obsidian pillager the Obsidilith seems indestructable. Stuck on a platform above the Void the it waits to be awakened challenged."
	]
