		"&9难度：&r &e中等"
		""
		"&e在银色地牢中发现。"
		""
		"&o&7The Valkyrie Queen is a warrior as old as time itself. She has fought many battles and has never been defeated. The legend says that one day during the War of Chaos she got hit by an ancient spell and has been sent to the heavens. Here stuck in a dungeon she has been slowly building her army waiting for a time to strike."
	]
