	quest.4CAE4459AEFE6D35.quest_desc: ["&6Ranged Damage&r are all &6Projectiles&r. The &6Further&r they &6Travel&r the &6Less Damage&r they will deal. &6Velocity&r helps with &6Delaying&r the &6Damage Reduction&r."]
