	quest.5ADD8D9CF89BEEA6.quest_desc: [
		"&e在这里你可以找到所有首领战的推荐顺序。&r"
		""
		"&7Killing a boss in a different order will still register, only the rewards can be claimed after all previous bosses have been defeated."
